<title>ANDORRA: CYCLING-ESCARTIN WINS TOUR OF CATALONIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ESCARTIN WINS TOUR OF CATALONIA.</headline>
<dateline>ANDORRA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fernando Escartin of Spain won the Tour of Catalonia on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sergei Uchkov won the 187 km eighth stage which started and finished in Andorra.</p>
</text>
